        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 31f14986-58f0-4292-ba42-cedf4b51b615).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Recently, we have been contacted by two different clients, a &quot;King Bowser&quot; and a &quot;King Boo&quot;, them both requesting that the Saltatore brothers are taken care of, as they&apos;ve been a massive thorn in their sides for quite some time now. You&apos;ll have to eliminate both of them before they finish their plumbing job underneath the Sapienza sewers. We have a small time frame here 47, but I know that this will be easy for you to complete. Good Luck.",
